<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux trade surplus narrows in February.</title>
<headline>Belgolux trade surplus narrows in February.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian National Accounts Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   Feb	 Jan     Feb '96 *</p>
<p>    Exports			    465.4     458.6   441.2 (433.2)</p>
<p>    Imports			    446.3     426.2   415.0 (408.0)</p>
<p>    Balance			     19.1	32.4    26.1 ( 25.2)</p>
<p>NOTE - * Year-earlier figures restated to take into account change in methodology used to calculate trade statistics. (Reported figures in brackets).</p>
<p>					 Jan-Feb 97	  Jan-Feb 96</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	   924.1		(853.8)</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	   872.5		(808.9)</p>
<p>    Balance			     51.6		( 44.9)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
